# No Co-authored-by commits

When creating git commits in this repository:

- Never add a `Co-authored-by:` trailer (or any co-author metadata) to the commit message.
- Never attribute the commit to Cursor, Copilot, Gemini, or any AI agent.
- Commit messages must contain only the human author's intended subject/body.
- After every commit, verify `git log -1 --format='%B'` has no `Co-authored-by`.
- If one was injected automatically and the commit is yours, unpushed, and just created: rewrite HEAD to drop the trailer before finishing.
